  "description": "Im Da-Jun became the leader of the runaway family after being kicked out of his house. Yeon-Woo, who he took in by chance, ends up in a knife assault in Yeonsu-gu, Incheon. The one who stopped Yeon-Woo from getting his revenge against the chaebol chairman was Yun Ga-Min, whose dream is to become a good student. Meanwhile, Na Hwa-Jin takes an interest and watches over them... \n\n(Source: Naver, translated) \n\n*Note: Belongs to Blue String universe.*",
